                    "Adam Sachs, senior vice president of podcast content at SiriusXM, gives the structural change plainly.  The power used to be in the network, he says, with horizontal networks of different shows that all shared a sensibility.  Now the approach is way more verticalized: working with specific talent rather than a specific network, and helping them build an ecosystem their fans can engage with.  His buying checklist is the line to keep: when we are making these deals, we are increasingly thinking about a podcast as audio, video, social and live, those four legs of the stool, and we want to be a part of all of it.",
